FRICTION_HELP = """powos friction - what got in the way, logged where it gets fixed for good

Hit friction (a refusal, a broken or flaky tool, an unclear rule, something slow)? Log it BEFORE you work
around it. The same area + kind + title counts up (no duplicates); the board sweeper's digest to the
